# Copy to proton.env and fill in. Do not put this value in chat.
#
# 1. Open https://account.proton.me/u/0/vpn/WireGuard
# 2. Create a config: platform GNU/Linux, Switzerland (or leave country and
#    Gluetun will pick a Swiss P2P server from SERVER_COUNTRIES)
# 3. Under VPN options enable NAT-PMP (Port Forwarding)
# 4. Paste only the PrivateKey base64 string below

WIREGUARD_PRIVATE_KEY=
